# vf_deid.py in this dir is a COPY of interface-container/dicomweb-s3/vf_deid.py,
# refreshed by sync-shared.sh. It is COMMITTED (not ignored) because CDK Docker
# bundling mounts only this dir as /asset-input and cannot reach the origin file
# at build time. Re-run ./sync-shared.sh whenever the dicomweb-s3 engine changes,
# and commit the refreshed copy. The dicomweb-s3 file remains the source of truth.
__pycache__/
